msgid "Exclude 24p"
msgstr "除了24帧视频"

#. Label of setting "System / Display / GUI saturation boost in HDR PQ mode"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#36095"
msgid "GUI saturation boost in HDR PQ mode"
msgstr "HDR模式SDR UI界面饱和度"

#. Description of setting with label #36095 "System / Display / GUI saturation boost in HDR PQ mode"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#36998"
msgid "Adjusts colour saturation for SDR GUI elements while the display is in HDR PQ mode (OSD, subtitles and other graphics). Does not affect HDR-authored PGS subtitles."
msgstr "当显示器处于HDR模式时，调整SDR界面元素（OSD、字幕及其他图形）的色彩饱和度，50%时保持源饱和度不变，不影响HDR原生PGS字幕。"

#. Label of setting "System / Display / Use system HDR/SDR brightness balance"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#36096"
msgid "Use system HDR/SDR brightness balance"
msgstr "使用系统 HDR/SDR 亮度平衡"

#. Label of setting "System / Display / GUI peak luminance in HDR PQ mode"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#36097"
msgid "GUI peak luminance in HDR PQ mode"
msgstr "HDR模式SDR UI界面峰值亮度"

#. Description of setting with label #36097 "System / Display / GUI peak luminance in HDR PQ mode"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#36547"
msgid "Adjusts how bright SDR GUI elements appear while the display is in HDR PQ mode (OSD, subtitles and other graphics). Does not affect HDR-authored PGS subtitles."
msgstr "当显示器处于HDR模式时，调整SDR界面元素（OSD、字幕及其他图形）的亮度，50%时保持源亮度不变，不影响HDR原生PGS字幕。"

#. Label for HDR-authored PGS subtitle luminance setting
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69211"
msgid "HDR PGS subtitle luminance"
msgstr "HDR模式PGS字幕亮度"

#. Help text for setting "HDR PGS subtitle luminance" of label #39211
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69212"
msgid "Adjusts brightness for HDR-authored PGS subtitles (BT.2020/PQ). 50% keeps source luminance unchanged."
msgstr "调整HDR原生PGS字幕（BT.2020/PQ）的亮度。50% 时保持源亮度不变。"

#. Label for HDR-authored PGS subtitle saturation setting
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69213"
msgid "HDR PGS subtitle saturation"
msgstr "HDR PGS字幕饱和度"

#. Help text for setting "HDR PGS subtitle saturation" of label #39213
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69214"
msgid "Adjusts color intensity for HDR-authored PGS subtitles (BT.2020/PQ). 50% keeps source saturation unchanged."
msgstr "调整HDR原生PGS字幕（BT.2020/PQ）的色彩饱和度。50%时保持源饱和度不变。"

#. Description of setting with label #295 "Low latency mode"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#36441"
msgid "Reduces audio processing latency. Improves playback start, unpause and seek (the audio returns sooner).\nYou can disable this setting if you experience audio issues."
msgstr "降低音频处理延迟。改善播放启动、取消暂停和搜索(音频更快恢复）。\n如果遇到音频问题，可禁用此设置。"

#. Indicates if Audio Engine should include lfe when downmixing
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#34131"
msgid "Include LFE when downmixing"
msgstr "下混时包含低音炮音轨"

#. Description of setting with label #34131 "Include LFE when downmixing"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#34132"
msgid "If enabled, this setting will include lfe channel into the mixing when there is no dedicated LFE output channel available. This only makes sense for full range speakers."
msgstr "如果启用，当没有专用的低音炮输出通道可用时，此设置会将低音炮通道纳入混音中。此设置仅对全频扬声器有意义。"

