#. "Dolby Vision"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60012"
msgid "Set Dolby Vision (DV) processing mode to On, On Demand, or Off. The Video Processor feature only works with DV Mode On Demand."
msgstr "将杜比视界 (DV) 处理模式设置为开启、自动(推荐设置)或关闭。视频处理器功能仅在杜比视界自动(推荐设置)模式下生效。"

#. "Dolby Vision"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60013"
msgid "On"
msgstr "强制开启(界面容易偏色)"

