msgstr "设置杜比视界输出类型"

#. "Dolby Vision Type"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60022"
msgid "Set type of DV output to use with display capability. This setting will only show options that your display is capable of processing. For SDR display the only option available is VS10 Only."
msgstr "设置与电视支持类型配合使用的杜比视界类型。此设置仅会显示您的电视支持的杜比视界类型。对于SDR显示器，唯一可用的选项是“仅VS10”。"

