msgstr "仅VS10(SDR电视)"

#. "Dolby Vision VSVDB"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60031"
msgid "Set DV VSVDB - If set to On it will replace Display DV VSVDB EDID"
msgstr "VSVDB(DV-Std和DV-LL模式关闭,其他模式开启)"

#. "Dolby Vision VSVDB"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60032"
msgid "Set DV VSVDB to replace Display DV VSVDB EDID with your specified values for Display \"Colour Space\" and \"Maximum Luminance\". If Display does not have a DV VSVDB EDID then these settings values will be used even if the \"Set DV VSVDB\" is set to Off. Toggle this setting from Off-On-Off to show your Display DV VSVDB EDID values."
msgstr "设置VSVDB，以自定义的显示器“色彩空间”和“最大亮度”值替换显示器的杜比视界VSVDB EDID信息。若显示器无杜比视界VSVDB EDID信息，即使“设置杜比视界VSVDB”设为关闭，仍会使用这些设置值。将此设置在“关闭-开启-关闭”间切换，可查看显示器的杜比视界VSVDB EDID值。"

