msgid "When both DV and HDR Vivid video streams are present, choose conversion from HDR Vivid video to DV over using the original DV video, note any FEL will be discarded in this case."
msgstr "当同时存在DV和HDR Vivid视频流时，选择将HDR Vivid视频转换为DV而非使用原始 DV 视频。请注意，在这种情况下，任何FEL都将被丢弃。"

