msgid "Disable HDR Vivid"
msgstr "禁用 HDR Vivid"

#. "Dolby Vision HDR Vivid disable help"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60137"
msgid "Enable this setting to strip all HDR Vivid dynamic metadata from the bitstream, degrading the content to standard HDR10. Conversion to Dolby Vision from HDR Vivid will be unavailable when this is enabled."
msgstr "开启此设置将从比特流中移除所有HDR Vivid动态元数据，将内容降级为标准HDR10。启用此设置后，将无法从HDR Vivid转换为Dolby Vision。"

#. "Dolby Vision Display Led Source Levels Metadata"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60150"
msgid "Set DV Metadata Level 5 to original source instead of zero"
msgstr "L5源级元数据"

#. "Dolby Vision Display Led Source Levels Metadata"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60151"
msgid "Enable this setting to send the original Source DV level 5 metadata to the display, otherwise zero is used for DV level 5 metadata values."
msgstr "启用此设置后，将向显示器发送原始源的杜比视界5级元数据；否则，杜比视界5级元数据值将使用零值。"

#. "Dolby Vision Display Led Level 5 Handling"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60152"
msgid "Enable this setting when using Level 5 as Source and the OSD/Subtitles are being hidden"
msgstr "当设置源值且OSD/字幕被隐藏时启用"

#. "Dolby Vision Display Led Level 5 Handling"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60153"
msgid "This setting allows you to see the OSD or Subtitles when using Level 5 as Source and your display not displaying them correctly."
msgstr "当将5级元数据设为源值且显示器无法正确显示屏幕显示菜单（OSD）或字幕时，此设置可让您正常看到这些内容。"

