#. "Dolby Vision Display Led Restrict Overlays"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60190"
msgid "Set to On to auto adjust subtitles further into the DV video/screen area"
msgstr "字幕调整屏幕区域"

#. "Dolby Vision Display Led Restrict Overlays"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60191"
msgid "Set to On only if subtitles are being position outside of the DV video/screen and not visible. This setting will automatically adjust the subtitles further into the DV video/screen area so they become visible. This setting only works for DV videos."
msgstr "仅当字幕被定位在杜比视界视频/屏幕区域外且无法看到时，将此设置设为开启。此设置会自动将字幕调整至杜比视界视频/屏幕区域内更靠里的位置，使其可见。该设置仅对杜比视界视频生效。"

