#. "Dolby Vision Display LL Dolby VSVDB Limit"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60571"
msgid "Set DV-LL Black Clipping/Level Correction. Off - No Correction = standard DV-LL Black Clipping at ~72 and Black Level at 64. Clipping Correction = Correction for Black Clipping to ~68 but raising Black Level to ~68. Balanced Correction = Correction for Black Clipping to ~68 and reducing the Black Level back to 64."
msgstr "设置DV-LL黑电平裁切/电平校正。关闭-无校正：标准DV-LL黑电平裁切值约为72，黑电平值为64；裁切校正：将黑电平裁切值校正至约68，但同时将黑电平值提升至约68；平衡校正：将黑电平裁切值校正至约68，并将黑电平值还原至64。"

