#. "Dolby Vision LL Bugfix"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60582"
msgid "Set bug fix option for DV-LL over brightness problem. Off - normal LLDV with no bug fix. Minimize - allows for any VSVDB Max Lum value and minimizes the over brightness problem. Limit - Limits the VSVDB Max Lum value to Source MDL value so no over brightness but restricts VSVDB Max Lum value to not pass the Source MDL value."
msgstr "设置DV-LL亮度异常问题的修复选项。关闭：正常LLDV模式，不启用修复；最小化：允许任意VSVDB最大亮度值，最大限度减轻亮度异常问题；限制：将VSVDB最大亮度值限制为源MDL值，无亮度异常但VSVDB最大亮度值不得超过源MDL值。"

