msgstr "自动选择播放器主导或视频处理器模式"

#. "Dolby Vision Type VP Auto"
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#60603"
msgid "Set this option to let the software automatically select between using normal Player Led versus Video Processor (VP) settings depending on your Display Max Lum capability (shown below) and the DV Video mastered MDL. When VP is in use the OSD will be a different colour. This feature only works with DV Mode On Demand."
msgstr "启用此选项后，软件将根据显示器的最大亮度能力（如下所示）与杜比视界母版元数据中的最大亮度值，自动选择采用常规播放器主导模式或视频处理器模式。当启用视频处理器模式时，屏幕菜单将显示不同颜色。此功能仅在“杜比视界自动”模式下生效。"

