#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69197"
msgid "Convert DV profile 7 FEL to MEL or to profile 8.1. Only use this setting if needed for audio sync issues with SoC S905X4. There is no need to use this setting with SoC S922X."
msgstr "将杜比视界7版本FEL转换为MEL或8.1版本。仅当S905X4芯片存在音频同步问题时需使用此设置，S922X芯片无需启用。"

