#. Setting label for E-AC-3 Atmos dialogue normalisation defeat
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#65005"
msgid "Include E-AC-3 Atmos (breaks Atmos)"
msgstr "包含DDP Atmos（会破坏 Atmos）"

#. Setting help for E-AC-3 Atmos dialogue normalisation defeat
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#65006"
msgid "Also apply dialogue normalisation defeat to E-AC-3 Dolby Atmos (DD+ Atmos) streams. This will disable Dolby Atmos object audio rendering — your receiver will fall back to standard Dolby Digital Plus surround. Safe to enable if your setup does not support Atmos."
msgstr "将中置声道禁用默认-4 dB重整值功能应用于 E-AC-3 Dolby Atmos（DD+ Atmos）流。这将禁用 Dolby Atmos 对象音频渲染，您的接收器将回退到标准 Dolby Digital Plus 环绕声。如果您的设备不支持 Atmos，启用此设置是安全的。"

#. Setting label for TrueHD Atmos dialogue normalisation defeat
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69351"
msgid "TrueHD Atmos dialogue normalisation defeat (0 dB)"
msgstr "TrueHD Atmos中置声道禁用默认-4 dB重整值（设为0 dB）"

#. Setting help for TrueHD Atmos dialogue normalisation defeat
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69352"
msgid "Force the dialogue normalisation value to (0 dB) in TrueHD Atmos bitstreams. This disables receiver-side dialogue normalisation for the Atmos presentation, preventing unwanted volume reduction during passthrough playback."
msgstr "强制将TrueHD Atmos比特流中的中置声道重整值设为0 dB(默认重整值为-4 dB)。防止播放期间出现对话音量降低。"

#. Setting label for AC-3/E-AC-3 dialogue normalisation defeat
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69353"
msgid "AC-3 / E-AC-3 dialogue normalisation defeat (0 dB)"
msgstr "AC-3 /E-AC-3中置声道禁用默认-4 dB重整值（设为0 dB）"

#. Setting help for AC-3/E-AC-3 dialogue normalisation defeat
#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69354"
msgid "Force the dialogue normalisation value to (0 dB) in AC-3 and E-AC-3 bitstreams. This disables receiver-side dialogue normalisation, preventing unwanted volume reduction during passthrough playback."
msgstr "强制将AC-3和E-AC-3比特流中的中置声道重整值设为0 dB(默认重整值为-4 dB)。防止播放期间出现对话音量降低。"

#: system/settings/settings.xml
msgctxt "#69999"
msgid "Enable this to disable noise reduction. Requires reboot. FOR BETTER VIDEO PROCESSING LEAVE THIS SETTING ENABLED (i.e., DISABLE NOISE REDUCTION)."
msgstr "启用此设置以关闭降噪功能。需重启设备生效。为获得更佳视频处理效果，请保持此设置为启用状态（即关闭降噪功能）。"